# AI integration rules

- Use the Responses API with strict JSON Schema structured output.
- AI may summarize and extract evidence; deterministic code owns scores and routes.
- Set model, prompt version, timeout, and output-token cap explicitly.
- Validate output again locally and route failures to human review.
- Do not send fields the prompt does not require.
